A face's strikeout metrics (GPUI patch for docs/plans/20261014-gpui-frontend.md Task 33): `TextSystem::font_strikeout`
returns the strikeout's position and thickness as the font's OS/2 table declares them (`yStrikeoutPosition`,
`yStrikeoutSize`), in font units, through a new `PlatformTextSystem::font_strikeout` whose default reads nothing, so
the platforms this series does not patch keep building. ngterm's terminal draws its strikethrough from them, as
Ghostty does, where it estimated before. An upstream candidate (Zed): read-only, no behavior change.
scripts/vendor-gpui.sh applies this after 0003.

diff -ruN a/src/platform.rs b/src/platform.rs
